Local transport control over a fifo.

Spotify Connect gives the device itself no way to press play, so the web
api and the front panel key feed play/pause/toggle/next/prev in through a
fifo and we replay them as spirc commands -- the same path a phone tap
takes, so track position and the app ui stay in sync.

